1
00:00:00,533 --> 00:00:02,266
=You Alone Know Me=

2
00:00:02,266 --> 00:00:03,893
(From the Qimao novel "My Bestie's Icy
Dad Got Drunk and Wild After We Wed")

3
00:00:03,893 --> 00:00:04,906
(Written by Qiaoqiaojiang)

4
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,040
=Episode 7=

5
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:11,119
Sir, what happened to her?

6
00:00:11,279 --> 00:00:12,679
Mangoes. A contact allergy.

7
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:13,679
Are you with her family?

8
00:00:13,839 --> 00:00:14,480
I'm her husband.

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:21,239
Don't scratch.

10
00:00:23,440 --> 00:00:24,120
It hurts.

11
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:25,800
Where does it hurt?

12
00:00:28,719 --> 00:00:29,199
Don't scratch.

13
00:00:44,493 --> 00:00:47,626
(People's Hospital)

14
00:00:58,640 --> 00:01:00,119
You're scared of needles?

15
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:23,640
Mr. Xie...

16
00:01:24,420 --> 00:01:26,466
♪I stand at the crossroads♪

17
00:01:26,813 --> 00:01:29,186
♪Waiting for your answer♪

18
00:01:31,980 --> 00:01:34,186
♪Holding flowers about to wilt♪

19
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,120
All done?

20
00:01:37,519 --> 00:01:39,239
With such a caring husband here,

21
00:01:39,439 --> 00:01:40,920
I bet you were too distracted

22
00:01:41,439 --> 00:01:42,480
to feel a thing, right?

23
00:01:43,420 --> 00:01:45,786
♪Some stories are true, some are lies♪

24
00:01:47,240 --> 00:01:49,570
♪Back then, I knew nothing of love♪

25
00:01:50,180 --> 00:01:52,386
♪We all wake from our dreams♪

26
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,680
(Why is he suddenly...)

27
00:01:55,480 --> 00:01:56,719
(We're married,)

28
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,000
(but...)

29
00:01:58,519 --> 00:02:00,159
(why is he suddenly so sweet to me?)

30
00:02:02,519 --> 00:02:03,040
Hua!

31
00:02:04,599 --> 00:02:05,400
How are you feeling?

32
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,760
I'm fine.

33
00:02:07,719 --> 00:02:08,120
Dad.

34
00:02:10,159 --> 00:02:10,879
Lin?

35
00:02:11,439 --> 00:02:12,439
You work here?

36
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:14,319
Yes, I just got assigned here.

37
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,319
A colleague mentioned

38
00:02:15,479 --> 00:02:17,560
a Lin Hua with a mango allergy,

39
00:02:17,719 --> 00:02:18,759
so I came to check.

40
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:20,479
I didn't expect it to be you.

41
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,479
Feeling better?

42
00:02:22,439 --> 00:02:23,039
I'm fine now.

43
00:02:24,360 --> 00:02:25,560
Thanks for checking on me, Lin.

44
00:02:29,639 --> 00:02:30,599
And this is...

45
00:02:34,719 --> 00:02:35,639
My dad.

46
00:02:37,080 --> 00:02:37,479
Dad,

47
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,520
this is Dr. Lin.

48
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:41,000
He was an upperclassman
at Hua's high school.

49
00:02:47,759 --> 00:02:48,159
Hello.

50
00:02:49,319 --> 00:02:50,439
I'm Lin Hua's boyfriend.

51
00:02:52,199 --> 00:02:53,159
(Nice one!)

52
00:02:53,560 --> 00:02:55,360
(Well played, Dad!)

53
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:58,520
You're so young,

54
00:02:58,960 --> 00:03:01,199
but your boyfriend's so mature
and refined.

55
00:03:03,560 --> 00:03:05,240
Hua, keep the injection site dry.

56
00:03:05,479 --> 00:03:06,439
Once you've finished this IV,

57
00:03:06,560 --> 00:03:07,520
you can go home tomorrow.

58
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:08,840
I've got rounds to do,

59
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:09,560
so I'll leave you to it.

60
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:12,879
Dad,

61
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:13,879
well,

62
00:03:14,479 --> 00:03:16,120
take good care of Mommy.

63
00:03:16,479 --> 00:03:17,319
I'm going back to school.

64
00:03:17,680 --> 00:03:18,479
For the next few days,

65
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:20,319
I'll be staying on campus.

66
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:22,680
Mommy's all yours.

67
00:03:23,199 --> 00:03:23,680
Go on.

68
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:24,479
Bao'er!

69
00:03:25,599 --> 00:03:26,120
Bao'er!

70
00:03:35,879 --> 00:03:36,560
Mr. Xie,

71
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,919
I'm fine now.

72
00:03:39,400 --> 00:03:40,479
If you're busy,

73
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:41,560
go ahead.

74
00:03:42,360 --> 00:03:43,039
I'm not busy.

75
00:03:43,800 --> 00:03:44,439
I canceled everything.

76
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:51,000
Here. Have some porridge.

77
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,439
I can do it myself.

78
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,280
I'm getting full.

79
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,120
You haven't eaten yet, have you?

80
00:04:14,400 --> 00:04:15,680
Why don't you go get something?

81
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:18,399
You don't want me to stay with you?

82
00:04:20,759 --> 00:04:21,519
No!

83
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,439
I'm just...

84
00:04:24,079 --> 00:04:24,879
worried you might...

85
00:04:33,759 --> 00:04:34,600
Now I'm full, too.

86
00:04:35,639 --> 00:04:36,800
No need to keep pushing me to eat.

87
00:04:52,560 --> 00:04:53,240
Mr. Xie,

88
00:04:54,519 --> 00:04:57,160
I think we need to clear things up.

89
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,360
Go ahead.

90
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:03,959
We're married,

91
00:05:05,360 --> 00:05:06,680
but it's a contract marriage.

92
00:05:09,079 --> 00:05:10,079
You don't have to

93
00:05:10,959 --> 00:05:12,360
waste your precious time on me.

94
00:05:12,480 --> 00:05:13,519
But I don't think

95
00:05:13,759 --> 00:05:15,040
looking after you is a waste of time.

96
00:05:16,800 --> 00:05:18,199
Besides, we're legally married.

97
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:22,040
I mean,

98
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:25,240
we should give each other
freedom and space.

99
00:05:25,800 --> 00:05:26,519
Stay out of each other's business,

100
00:05:27,439 --> 00:05:28,639
just like our agreement says.

101
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:29,920
But you're sick.

102
00:05:31,399 --> 00:05:33,160
It's my duty as your husband
to take care of you.

103
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:40,680
Or is it that...

104
00:05:43,319 --> 00:05:44,160
you think I'm too old?

105
00:05:44,879 --> 00:05:45,480
You're not old.

106
00:05:50,680 --> 00:05:51,680
I'm just...

107
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,680
(afraid you'll be too good to me.)

108
00:05:54,639 --> 00:05:55,759
(And I'll let my guard down.)

109
00:05:56,160 --> 00:05:57,040
(If I fall in love...)

110
00:05:59,399 --> 00:06:01,120
(I don't want to get hurt again.)

111
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:03,234
♪I heard the winds knock on my window♪

112
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:05,160
♪I heard the name inside the rain♪

113
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:05,759
(Maybe)

114
00:06:06,279 --> 00:06:08,439
(I've been too controlling lately.)

115
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:14,360
♪I heard the whisper from a lifetime,
calling me back again♪

116
00:06:14,470 --> 00:06:18,182
♪Every, every lonely hour♪

117
00:06:18,182 --> 00:06:21,611
♪Every tear I tried to hide♪

118
00:06:23,279 --> 00:06:23,879
I understand.

119
00:06:23,906 --> 00:06:25,680
♪Was only leading me to you♪

120
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:29,420
♪Across the endless time♪

121
00:06:29,931 --> 00:06:33,554
♪Even if the sky is falling♪

122
00:06:33,554 --> 00:06:37,257
♪Even if the doom will come♪

123
00:06:37,260 --> 00:06:41,017
♪I will keep your name inside me♪

124
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:45,085
♪Like the only light I trust♪

125
00:06:45,090 --> 00:06:48,502
♪When the whole world fades to silence♪

126
00:06:48,502 --> 00:06:52,148
♪When forever feels too far♪

127
00:06:52,640 --> 00:06:56,200
♪Even if the sky is falling♪

128
00:06:56,200 --> 00:07:01,171
♪Even if the doom will come♪

129
00:07:01,171 --> 00:07:03,840
♪I will keep your name inside me♪

130
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:07,588
♪Like the only light I trust♪
(Signature page, Party A Xie Zhouhan)

131
00:07:07,590 --> 00:07:11,108
♪When the whole world fades to silence♪

132
00:07:11,110 --> 00:07:14,674
♪When forever feels too far♪

133
00:07:15,090 --> 00:07:18,720
♪I will still believe this love♪

134
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:24,365
♪Was written in my stars♪

135
00:07:24,370 --> 00:07:28,297
♪You are written in stars♪

136
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:31,988
♪You are the light inside my sky♪

137
00:07:31,990 --> 00:07:38,777
♪Every breath, every heartbeat has been
waiting where you are♪

138
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:43,017
♪You are written in my soul♪

139
00:07:43,020 --> 00:07:46,937
♪You are the place I call my home♪

140
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:50,754
♪If I fall, if I break apart♪

141
00:07:50,754 --> 00:07:54,720
♪Let me fall into your arms♪

142
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:58,011
♪Let me fall into your arms♪

143
00:07:58,011 --> 00:08:02,217
♪Where I was always meant to be♪

144
00:08:03,017 --> 00:08:07,680
♪You are written in the stars♪

145
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:14,034
♪You are written here with me♪
